# onnxruntime-node, a dependency of @huggingface/transformers, downloads CUDA
# binaries from github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime in its postinstall on Linux x64,
# and `npm ci` fails when that address does not answer. No runner or machine
# here has a GPU, so the CUDA provider is never used: skip the download.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
